-- สมมติฐาน: แบ่งตามอันดับเปอร์เซ็นไทล์ของยอดเฉลี่ย/วัน; ยอดเท่ากันอยู่กลุ่มเดียวกัน
with source as (
    select gas_station_id,gas_station_name, sum(sales_amount) as total_sales,
        count(*) as calendar_days,avg(sales_amount) as avg_daily_sales
    from (select s.gas_station_id,s.gas_station_name,s.street,d.date_id,d.date_day,
d.weekday_number,d.weekday_name,d.day_type,
coalesce(sum(f.total_amount),0) as sales_amount,count(f.invoice_id) as invoice_count
from selected_stations s cross join selected_dates d
left join selected_invoices f on s.gas_station_id=f.gas_station_id and d.date_id=f.date_id
group by 1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8) group by 1,2
), ranked as (
    select *,percent_rank() over(order by avg_daily_sales) as sales_percentile from source
), tiers as (
    select *,case when sales_percentile >= 2.0/3 then 'High'
        when sales_percentile >= 1.0/3 then 'Medium' else 'Low' end as sales_tier
    from ranked
)
select *,count(*) over(partition by sales_tier) as stations_in_tier,
    100.0*count(*) over(partition by sales_tier)/count(*) over() as tier_share_pct
from tiers
